  (layer "F.Cu")
  (tedit 5DC5F6A4)
  (descr "Keystone 7770 (metric M3, vertical, press-in). Drawn from the Keystone drawing: four 1.52 mm square pins, 5.00 x 7.01 mm, holes 1.85 mm. All pads are one terminal. Check against a sample before layout is frozen.")
